{"title":"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d0a9ee38d0192e6dfeae399da40254f1fd074f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^3 + 2^3}{2^{-3} + 2^{-3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4ab84159b7aeedb027844ede1edc0e6bcbed76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A) } 16 \\qquad \\textbf {(B) } 24 \\qquad \\textbf {(C) } 32 \\qquad \\textbf {(D) } 48 \\qquad \\textbf {(E) } 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can synchronously multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/3/9a3973ce02dcd1185abc54b45480e6b018ad4ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2^3}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to the expresions both above and below the fraction bar. Thus, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f61712212b2338ec47df60099f80f0e4a58c157.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2^3+2^3}{2^{-3}+2^{-3}}\\\\=\\frac{2^6+2^6}{1+1}\\\\={2^6}.\\]\" width=\"206\" height=\"40\" />\nHence, the fraction equals to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cdbaf16cbc366fd55e16b51513f6a12c27cb036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{{\\textbf{(E) }64}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f746975ff2b7b39e12fbe1865ec81670932b221.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2^3+2^3}{2^{-3}+2^{-3}} = \\frac{8 + 8}{\\frac{1}{8} + \\frac{1}{8}} = \\frac{16}{\\frac{1}{4}} = 16 \\cdot 4 = 64,\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"45\" /> so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/89543fbb3653af6e08fa9cb9c1b6513b2f0a75af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{{(\\textbf{E) }64}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NwWf1uYFZqw\">https://youtu.be/NwWf1uYFZqw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vLFULrT_7yk\">https://youtu.be/vLFULrT_7yk</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;tex